  CLASS_DECL
    LINE_COMMENT "// A covergroup is sampled on an event or by a `sample` function. Its cover"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// points and crosses hold bins and options; bins count values, the values of"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// a cover point `with` a condition, transitions, what no other bin counts, or"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// in a cross a selection of other bins, and how many of them `matches`. A"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// covergroup may extend a base class's, and be sampled as a method starts."
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    CLASS_KW "class"
    WHITESPACE " "
    IDENT "c"
    SEMICOLON ";"
